ual assault, or non-consensual sexual content. Nudity is presented in a neutral, non-erotic manner and is intended to support realism and atmosphere rather than for sexual purposes.\r\n\r\nAdditional mature themes may include references to death, societal collapse, and survival under extreme conditions. The game does not depict self-harm or promote drug or alcohol abuse."}, "ratings": {"dejus": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "14", "required_age": "14", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Nudez\nViolência\nLinguagem imprópria"}, "steam_germany": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "16", "required_age": "16", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Drastische Gewalt\nSchimpfwörte"}, "igrs": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "BANNED", "required_age": "2147483647", "banned": "1", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Kekerasan\nPenggunaan bahasa"}}}}}